{
  "schema": "skill/1",
  "batch": "batch-006-wildlands",
  "note": "REQ-0207 -- three synergy engines, one per pack. WILD HUNT: lifesteal tempo (feral_bite, blood_drain, impish_drain sustain through damage). VENOM NEST: a Poison engine -- spider/snake APPLY Poison (venom_bite, venom_spit), scorpion/basilisk CONVERT it via the ACTIVE bonus_vs_status verb x mult (stinger, toxic_maw). DEMON GATE: a Burn engine -- imp/demon_lord APPLY Burn (fire_dart, dominion_of_flame), gargoyle CONVERTS it (molten_talons). multi_strike follows REQ-0203 bone_breath semantics: n=[lo,hi] per hit x hits (each sub-hit a separate on-hit event). Attack profiles follow ruling 7 typing (batch-002/005 conventions); aoe_statuses is only authored with aoe>=1 so it is never inert.",
